<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28360" root="عدن" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِدَّانٌ</span></b> , signifying <i>A time,</i> [as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَدَّانٌ</span>,] is
said by some to be of the measure <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِعْلَالٌ</span> [a
mistranscription for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِعَّالٌ</span>] from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَدَنَ</span>; but Fr
held it to be more probably of the measure <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِعْلَانٌ</span>
from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">العَدّ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">العِدَاد</span>, in the place of which [i. e.
in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عد</span>] it has been mentioned. (TA.)

